---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Long Answer Trainer | A-level DT"><main class="page"><header><span class="eyebrow">EXTENDED RESPONSE PRACTICE</span><h1>Long-answer trainer<span>.</span></h1><p>Practise developing and applying your DT knowledge before checking the ingredients of a strong response.</p></header><section class="card"><div class="meta"><span>JUSTIFY</span><strong>6 marks</strong></div><h2>A manufacturer is selecting additives for a polymer casing used in a vehicle. Justify the use of suitable additives for this application.</h2><textarea rows="11" placeholder="Write your answer here..."></textarea><button class="show">Check what a strong answer needs</button><div class="points" hidden><span>CHECK YOUR RESPONSE</span><label><input type="checkbox"/>Select suitable additives</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>Explain the property or performance change</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>Apply the points specifically to a vehicle casing</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>Develop reasons rather than listing features</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>Support the final choice with relevant evidence</label><p>This is a self-check guide, not an automatic AQA mark.</p></div></section></main><script is:inline>document.querySelector('.show').onclick=e=>{const p=e.target.nextElementSibling;p.hidden=!p.hidden}</script></Base><style>.page{padding:48px clamp(24px,7vw,110px) 90px;background:#fbf8f5;min-height:100vh}.page header{max-width:850px}.page h1{font-size:clamp(45px,5vw,72px);margin:12px 0}.page h1 span{color:#9c61b9}.page header p{font-size:18px;color:#6d6074}.card{margin-top:35px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6dbe9;border-radius:17px;padding:clamp(25px,4vw,48px)}.meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#8554a2;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.card h2{font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,38px);max-width:950px;margin:22px 0}.card textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid #ded3e3;border-radius:10px;padding:18px;font:500 17px 'DM Sans';background:#fdfafd}.show{margin-top:14px;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:#482166;color:#fff;padding:14px 20px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.points{margin-top:25px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#f1e6f8,#fff8ef);border:1px solid #e7d9ea;border-radius:12px;padding:24px}.points>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800;color:#81539d}.points label{display:block;margin:13px 0}.points input{margin-right:10px}.points p{font-size:11px;color:#77697d;margin-bottom:0}</style>